  "description": "Fast where it matters. Fun everywhere else.The Rambler is a titanium all-road bike built for riders who want a sharper, more agile feel without sacrificing versatility. Designed for everything from fast gravel loops to endurance road days, it thrives on mixed terrain and rewards an active riding style.\nShorter, quicker, and more responsive than the Wanderer, The Rambler brings a lively ride to every surface. The steeper front end delivers precise, agile steering for tighter racing and punchy terrain, while the higher bottom bracket gives you confidence when the ride tips off-road or into CX territory.\nBuilt to run wide slick tyres, The Rambler balances speed and comfort — rolling fast on tarmac while staying composed when the road disappears. Crafted from premium Grade 9 titanium, it delivers a smooth, resilient ride that’s built to last.",
